sequenceDiagram
  actor Buyer
  actor Seller
  participant Web as Controllers
  participant Service as MarketplaceService
  participant DB as MySQL
  Buyer->>Web: Submit purchase request
  Web->>Service: requestItem(itemId, currentUser)
  Service->>DB: Lock item, validate, insert pending request
  Seller->>Web: Accept request
  Web->>Service: accept(requestId, currentUser)
  Service->>DB: Begin READ_COMMITTED transaction; lock item
  Service->>DB: Refresh request and verify seller/status
  Service->>DB: Accept request; insert trade; mark sold
  Service->>DB: Reject other pending requests; commit
  Web-->>Seller: Show accepted notice
  Buyer->>Web: Submit seller review from trade history

